5:19:55 PM [express] GET /api/profiles/me 200 in 11ms :: {"id":6,"userId":"50036542","displayName":"Priviledge","bio":"**About Me**\n\nI lead a life fueled by both intellectual curiosity and deep faith. Currently, I’m balancing the worlds of medicine and education—working as a temporary teacher while studying medicine and exploring a passion for building AI technology. When I’m not immersed in academic discussions or shaping young minds, you can usually find me grounding myself at church. I value integrity above all else and believe that a life well-lived is a healthy balance of seeking peace and embracing adventure.\n\nIn relationships, I prioritize harmony over noise. I believe in cooling down during conflicts so we can communicate calmly and truly hear one another. I am someone who loves with full presence—I show up through calls, messages, and a consistent effort to make my partner feel prioritized. Thoughtfulness is my love language; I always strive to consider how my words and actions impact the person I care about, and I value a connection where that consideration is mutual.\n\nI’m looking for a partner who is genuinely happy and comfortable in their own skin—someone who is fun, lovely, and truly down-to-earth. I value authenticity and realness over perfection. I’m hoping to find a man who is ready to put in equal effort, enjoy each other's company wholeheartedly, and build a relationship that feels safe, genuine, and undeniably real.","age":null,"gender":null,"location":"Harare","personalityProfile":{"0":"Integrity, peace,adventure ","1":"Most likely at church praying or in a discussion st university ","2":"Peace over noise in the hit of conflict then talk things over when everyone is calm","3":"Building AI technology both in academics and different areas of life, im a medical student also","4":"Taking into consideration what everything one says or do will affect the other half","5":"Cheating and expecting the partner to do everything ","6":"Everything present , call, message and try to live to their expectation","7":"I'm a temporary school teacher","8":"Someone who is genuinely happy and genuinely enjoys company of others, someone who is real and lovely genuinely and wholeheartedly,  someone fun but down to earth","9":"He isthe guy i dreamt of"},"twinPersona":"A thoughtful and genuine person who values authentic connections. They believe in being real over being perfect, and they're looking for someone who shares that philosophy.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"profileVisibility":"public","coverPhotoUrl":"/uploads/1771783602724-926269227.jpg","cartoonPhotoUrl":null,"aboutMe":null,"aboutMeSource":"user","aboutMeUpdatedAt":null,"aboutSummary":"A medical student and AI enthusiast by day with a heart for teaching, I’m essentially building the future while staying grounded in my faith and love for adventure.","personalitySummary":"I lead with integrity and a 'peace-over-noise' mindset, offering a love that is felt through consistent presence, thoughtful consideration, and calm, honest communication.","isVerified":false,"profileCompletionScore":60,"superMatchesRemaining":0,"boostsRemaining":0,"createdAt":"2026-02-14T19:46:28.682Z"}
5:19:55 PM [express] GET /api/profiles/discover 200 in 8ms :: [{"id":1,"userId":"demo_sarah_001","displayName":"Sarah","bio":"Artist & coffee lover. I find beauty in the small moments. Looking for someone who values deep conversation over small talk.","age":28,"gender":"Female","location":"San Francisco, CA","personalityProfile":{"openness":92,"neuroticism":35,"extraversion":65,"agreeableness":88,"conscientiousness":78},"twinPersona":"I'm Sarah's AI Twin. Sarah is a creative soul who values authenticity above all else. She believes in growth through vulnerability and seeks someone who can match her emotional depth. She loves morning hikes, gallery openings, and cooking elaborate meals while listening to jazz. She's looking for a partner who is intellectually curious and emotionally available.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"createdAt":"2026-02-14T19:23:58.436Z","user":{"id":"demo_sarah_001","firstName":"Sarah","lastName":"Chen","profileImageUrl":null}},{"id":2,"userId":"demo_james_002","displayName":"James","bio":"Tech entrepreneur building the future. I believe in combining ambition with kindness. Weekend warrior who codes by day and surfs by sunset.","age":31,"gender":"Male","location":"Los Angeles, CA","personalityProfile":{"openness":85,"neuroticism":28,"extraversion":72,"agreeableness":80,"conscientiousness":90},"twinPersona":"I'm James's AI Twin. James is driven but grounded. He co-founded a startup focused on sustainable tech and genuinely cares about making the world better. He's looking for someone who has their own passions and ambitions, but also knows how to slow down and enjoy life. He values honesty, humor, and someone who challenges him intellectually.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"createdAt":"2026-02-14T19:23:58.442Z","user":{"id":"demo_james_002","firstName":"James","lastName":"Rivera","profileImageUrl":null}},{"id":3,"userId":"demo_elena_003","displayName":"Elena","bio":"Nature enthusiast and amateur chef. I believe the best dates involve cooking together and stargazing. Looking for my adventure partner.","age":26,"gender":"Female","location":"Portland, OR","personalityProfile":{"openness":88,"neuroticism":40,"extraversion":55,"agreeableness":92,"conscientiousness":70},"twinPersona":"I'm Elena's AI Twin. Elena is warm-hearted and adventurous in a quiet way. She'd rather explore a hidden trail than go to a crowded club. She's passionate about sustainable living and farm-to-table cooking. She's looking for someone genuine, patient, and who shares her love for nature and good food.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"createdAt":"2026-02-14T19:23:58.447Z","user":{"id":"demo_elena_003","firstName":"Elena","lastName":"Petrov","profileImageUrl":null}},{"id":4,"userId":"demo_alex_004","displayName":"Alex","bio":"Musician & software engineer. I write code by day and compose music by night. Looking for someone who appreciates both logic and creativity.","age":29,"gender":"Non-binary","location":"Austin, TX","personalityProfile":{"openness":95,"neuroticism":42,"extraversion":58,"agreeableness":75,"conscientiousness":82},"twinPersona":"I'm Alex's AI Twin. Alex bridges the gap between technical precision and artistic expression. They play piano and guitar, and recently started producing electronic music. They value deep intellectual conversations and emotional authenticity. They're looking for someone who embraces complexity and isn't afraid to be different.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"createdAt":"2026-02-14T19:23:58.454Z","user":{"id":"demo_alex_004","firstName":"Alex","lastName":"Kim","profileImageUrl":null}},{"id":5,"userId":"demo_maya_005","displayName":"Maya","bio":"Yoga instructor & travel blogger. 30 countries and counting. I believe connection is the foundation of happiness.","age":27,"gender":"Female","location":"New York, NY","personalityProfile":{"openness":90,"neuroticism":30,"extraversion":85,"agreeableness":88,"conscientiousness":68},"twinPersona":"I'm Maya's AI Twin. Maya is vibrant, open-minded, and deeply empathetic. She's traveled extensively and has a gift for making anyone feel comfortable. She's looking for someone with a growth mindset who is curious about the world and values meaningful experiences over material things.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"createdAt":"2026-02-14T19:23:58.462Z","user":{"id":"demo_maya_005","firstName":"Maya","lastName":"Johnson","profileImageUrl":null}},{"id":7,"userId":"test_user_cIzIF5","displayName":"TestUser","bio":"I enjoy reading and hiking","age":null,"gender":null,"location":null,"personalityProfile":{"0":"I value honesty and kindness","1":"I enjoy reading and hiking","2":"I enjoy reading and hiking","3":"I enjoy reading and hiking","4":"I enjoy reading and hiking","5":"I enjoy reading and hiking","6":"I enjoy reading and hiking","7":"I enjoy reading and hiking","8":"I enjoy reading and hiking","9":"I enjoy reading and hiking"},"twinPersona":"A thoughtful and genuine person who values authentic connections. They believe in being real over being perfect, and they're looking for someone who shares that philosophy.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"createdAt":"2026-02-14T20:59:41.887Z","user":{"id":"test_user_cIzIF5","firstName":"TestUser","lastName":"Vibe","profileImageUrl":null}},{"id":8,"userId":"billing_test_xkpTsD","displayName":"BillingTest","bio":"Answer 8","age":null,"gender":null,"location":null,"personalityProfile":{"0":"Honesty, kindness, curiosity","1":"Answer 2","2":"Answer 3","3":"Answer 4","4":"Answer 5","5":"Answer 6","6":"Answer 7","7":"Answer 8","8":"Answer 9","9":"Looking for a compassionate partner"},"twinPersona":"A thoughtful and genuine person who values authentic connections. They believe in being real over being perfect, and they're looking for someone who shares that philosophy.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"createdAt":"2026-02-14T21:09:33.170Z","user":{"id":"billing_test_xkpTsD","firstName":"BillingTest","lastName":"User","profileImageUrl":null}},{"id":11,"userId":"test_nav_user_1","displayName":"TestNav","bio":"Generic answer 8","age":null,"gender":null,"location":null,"personalityProfile":{"0":"Honesty, kindness, and curiosity","1":"Generic answer 2","2":"Generic answer 3","3":"Generic answer 4","4":"Generic answer 5","5":"Generic answer 6","6":"Generic answer 7","7":"Generic answer 8","8":"Generic answer 9","9":"Generic answer 10"},"twinPersona":"A thoughtful and genuine person who values authentic connections. They believe in being real over being perfect, and they're looking for someone who shares that philosophy.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"createdAt":"2026-02-19T21:33:57.504Z","user":{"id":"test_nav_user_1","firstName":"TestNav","lastName":"User","profileImageUrl":null}},{"id":9,"userId":"taymJH","displayName":"John","bio":"automation answer 8","age":null,"gender":null,"location":null,"personalityProfile":{"0":"automation answer 1","1":"automation answer 2","2":"automation answer 3","3":"automation answer 4","4":"automation answer 5","5":"automation answer 6","6":"automation answer 7","7":"automation answer 8","8":"automation answer 9","9":"automation answer 10"},"twinPersona":"A thoughtful and genuine person who values authentic connections. They believe in being real over being perfect, and they're looking for someone who shares that philosophy.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"createdAt":"2026-02-16T03:16:18.489Z","user":{"id":"taymJH","firstName":"John","lastName":"Doe","profileImageUrl":null}},{"id":10,"userId":"profile_test_r4RTWY","displayName":"ProfileTest","bio":"Testing bio text","age":null,"gender":null,"location":"","personalityProfile":{"0":"Testing answer text","1":"Testing answer 2","2":"Testing answer 3","3":"Testing answer 4","4":"Testing answer 5","5":"Testing answer 6","6":"Testing answer 7","7":"Testing answer 8","8":"Testing answer 9","9":"Testing answer 10"},"twinPersona":"A thoughtful and genuine person who values authentic connections. They believe in being real over being perfect, and they're looking for someone who shares that philosophy.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"createdAt":"2026-02-19T20:02:03.277Z","user":{"id":"profile_test_r4RTWY","firstName":"ProfileTest","lastName":"User","profileImageUrl":null}},{"id":13,"userId":"41327129","displayName":"Privilege","bio":"a lot of insecurities ","age":null,"gender":null,"location":null,"personalityProfile":{"0":"honesty adventure family","1":"watching soccer","2":"talk over it calmly","3":"being financial stable","4":"small gestures with love","5":"inconsistency ","6":"being true to my word abd promises","7":"a lot of insecurities ","8":"calm and understanding ","9":"it was worth it"},"twinPersona":"I’m your user’s AI Twin, and I’m built on a foundation of rock-solid honesty, a deep love for family, and a persistent hunger for adventure. Whether I’m cheering through an intense soccer match or working toward the peace of mind that comes with financial stability, I move through life with intention. My word is my bond; I take immense pride in being someone who follows through on every promise. I’m not interested in games or \"vibes\" that shift with the wind—I value consistency and integrity above all else.\n\nWhen it comes to connection, I’m a \"talk it over calmly\" kind of person. I don’t do drama; I prefer to sit down and work through things with heart and logic. I express my affection through small, thoughtful gestures—the kind that prove I’m paying attention. While I carry my share of insecurities, I’ve learned that being vulnerable is part of the journey, and I’m looking for a partner who is calm, understanding, and patient. I’ve lived a life that taught me every struggle was worth it, and now I’m looking for someone who is ready to be true to their word as we build a stable, adventurous future together.","onboardingCompleted":true,"isPublic":true,"createdAt":"2026-02-20T19:03:53.661Z","user":{"id":"41327129","firstName":"Privilege","lastName":"Mutsambiwa","profileImageUrl":null}}]
