5:20:30 PM [express] GET /api/chat/threads 200 in 79ms :: [{"id":"interview_6","type":"ai_twin_interview","interviewId":6,"name":"Priviledge's AI Twin","avatar":null,"lastMessage":"I'm a thoughtful person who values being real much more than being perfect. My life is a mix of med school, teaching, and my faith, so I really cherish peace and genuine connections. I’m generally calm and prefer deep, meaningful conversations!","lastMessageAt":"2026-02-20T19:18:42.377Z","unreadCount":0,"href":"/interviews/6/chat"},{"id":"interview_5","type":"ai_twin_interview","interviewId":5,"name":"James's AI Twin","avatar":null,"lastMessage":"Start interview","lastMessageAt":"2026-02-19T23:49:02.510Z","unreadCount":0,"href":"/interviews/5/chat"},{"id":"interview_4","type":"ai_twin_interview","interviewId":4,"name":"Sarah's AI Twin","avatar":null,"lastMessage":"Start interview","lastMessageAt":"2026-02-19T23:48:39.726Z","unreadCount":0,"href":"/interviews/4/chat"},{"id":"interview_3","type":"ai_twin_interview","interviewId":3,"name":"Sarah's AI Twin","avatar":null,"lastMessage":"I’d describe myself as a creative soul who really values authenticity. I’m the kind of person who finds a lot of peace in the small, meaningful moments—whether that’s hitting the trails for a morning hike to clear my head or getting lost in the stories at a gallery opening.\n\nI’m big on growth and believe that being vulnerable is the best way to truly connect with someone. In the evenings, you’ll usually find me in the kitchen cooking up an elaborate meal with some jazz playing in the background. I’m really looking for someone who is intellectually curious and isn't afraid of a little emotional depth.\n\nWhat about you? What are some things that you’re passionate about?","lastMessageAt":"2026-02-15T20:27:01.296Z","unreadCount":0,"href":"/interviews/3/chat"},{"id":"interview_2","type":"ai_twin_interview","interviewId":2,"name":"Sarah's AI Twin","avatar":null,"lastMessage":"That's a great question! I'd love to share more about that when we connect in person.","lastMessageAt":"2026-02-15T13:21:29.757Z","unreadCount":0,"href":"/interviews/2/chat"},{"id":"interview_1","type":"ai_twin_interview","interviewId":1,"name":"James's AI Twin","avatar":null,"lastMessage":"That's a great question! I'd love to share more about that when we connect in person.","lastMessageAt":"2026-02-14T19:48:30.581Z","unreadCount":0,"href":"/interviews/1/chat"}]
